                {
                  "id": "h-when-to-schedule",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When Should You Schedule a Diesel Engine Diagnostic?",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "when-to-schedule"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-when-to-schedule-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Don't wait for failure. You should schedule a diesel engine diagnostic if:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-when-to-schedule-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "You see warning lights"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Performance drops"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Fuel efficiency changes"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Your truck is nearing major service intervals"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "You're preparing for long-haul travel"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-when-to-schedule-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Proactive diagnostics are cheaper than emergency repairs. For fleets, routine diesel engine diagnostics reduce unexpected downtime and extend engine life. For owner-operators, it protects your income and reputation with customers.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-get-back-on-road",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Quick, Easy Engine Diagnostic to Get Back on the Road",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "get-back-on-road"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-get-back-on-road-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Your truck works hard. It deserves attention before small issues turn into major repairs. A professional diesel engine diagnostic gives you answers, protects your investment, and keeps your business moving forward. Whether you operate a single truck or manage a growing fleet, early detection saves money and stress.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-get-back-on-road-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At Sun State International, we believe in doing the job right the first time. We value relationships. We honor commitments. And we show up when you need us. If something feels off with your engine, trust your instincts, and trust the team that's built its reputation on dependable care. Your business matters to us. And we're here to help you stay on the road.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "actions-get-back-on-road-3",
                  "type": "buttons",
                  "props": {
